    // edge; root highlighted filled #e1f5fe; edges grouped by
    // source|kind|label (single -> "a" -> "b"; many -> { t1 t2 });
    // implements dashed, owns arrowhead diamond, calls dotted;
    // no edges -> bare node lines; truncated -> trailing comment.
    // DEFECT: Map grouping + template strings -> buffer appends.
    return 0;
}
